      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Particle systems synced using IKFollower don't get destroyed and stays in the world.\n1 is normal PS that is not using IKFollower\n2 is previous PS that is synced using a IKFollower.\n3 and 4 are PS that is synced using a IKFollower displayed in the avatar selection menu.\n\n1 is actually displayed in a mirror, 2 3 and 4 are not in the mirror.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
