      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can you be more specific here? Why are you using IKFollower in this case, since it doesn't appear to be an emitter that requires worldspace emission? \n\nIs it parented directly to your head bone? It looks like it is parented to the ear bone, which is not an IK-driven bone. \n\nPlease test a case with a simple emitter paired from one of the compatible bones listed in our documentation, firing a particle into worldspace.\n\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/v2019.1.1/docs/vrc_ikfollower\n\nYou can also provide the avatar ID if you'd like, and I can take a closer look at what you're doing.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
