      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}:\nI use IKFollower here is because a previous issue i submitted in Bug-reports https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/avatars-child-objects-bounding-box-does-not-move-with-height-changes\nThat issue was fixed by this beta update, but the IKFollower also get other issues introduced by the update, hence this post.\nDo you still need to inspect what i did? i had deleted that testing avatar, if you still need it, i can re-do it.\nThe way i did it was: create an empty object as a child of head bone, attach a IKFollower component to it, and move everything that were parented to head bone under it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
